        <detaileddescription>
<para>Reads the material operand and the interface thickness from the current interface cell.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="attention"><para>this is a first draft of the method that only works for piecewise constant scalar variables.</para>
</simplesect>
<xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000110"><xreftitle>Todo</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>fix for vector or tensor material operands which may be needed if the permeability is a vector or tensor </para>
<para>use harmonic mean of the permeabilities of the parent elements on the inside and outside. </para>
<para>implement for integration point variables </para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
